  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#19041\", \"PowerToys#27699\", \"PowerToys#30801\"], \"answer\": \"Global mouse gestures, such as holding a button and moving to trigger a hotkey, have been requested before. The main tracking ticket is PowerToys#19041. Other requests, such as #27699, were closed as duplicates of it. PowerToys has no such feature, and the last comments on #19041 say there has been no progress. The maintainers said they would keep the request open but rank it below other work, such as macro support. Add a thumbs-up or your use case to #19041. In the meantime, use a third-party tool. The tickets suggest StrokePlus.net, the AutoHotkey script MouseGestureL, and Kando. The gesture software that ships with some mice, such as Logitech Options+, is another option.\"}",
